        "definition_long": "Question: Do women have the ability to make meaningful decisions in key areas of their lives?\nClarification: Women's civil liberties are understood to include freedom of domestic movement, the right to private property, freedom from forced labor, and access to justice.\nScale: Interval, from low to high (0-1).\n",
